{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Being alone doesn't have to be lonely.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621840/extras/1ea708ea3b9eaee96620f99c770f8d7e.apng?t=1774124296\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621840/extras/1ea708ea3b9eaee96620f99c770f8d7e.poster.avif?t=1774124296\" class=\"bb_img\" width=488 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have your very own goth girl that will begrudgingly keep you company 24/7. This desktop companion silently judges everything you do.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will always be there but not because she wants to be</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light her cigarette and maybe she'll start thinking about you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disrupt her gaze into the abyss to get some attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own custom dialogue for her to parrot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can't be fixed and you'll like it that way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Follow us for update alerts!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621840/extras/7f546c1041dffbf27519884de609689a.avif?t=1774124296\" width=432 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0&gt;&gt;&gt;\u00a0 \u00a0&gt;&gt;&gt;\u00a0 \u00a0 &gt;&gt;&gt;\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Click the link over on the right\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0&gt;&gt;&gt;\u00a0 \u00a0&gt;&gt;&gt;\u00a0 \u00a0 &gt;&g